o be okay  56 year old pamela orlando died two  hours  after her boys went to see her gail  david that that video is so tough to  watch because you can actually see  her slipping away and what's painful to  me is she probably  knew she was slipping away but yet she  wanted to document this story  that in hopes of maybe helping others to  let people know as her son said how bad  this is  that's very tough to watch and i i can't  i feel for her sons  her sons who are watching this video and  who she was you know gail i spoke with a  friend of hers  who's a nurse at the hospital and she  said that every day she'd bring a phone  to pam's ear and she'd place it  by the ear and pam was on a ventilator  so she was unconscious but  every time the boys would talk her heart  rate which was beating rapidly would  drop considerably  and her oxygen levels would go up  notably  and so that was a sign to the friend and  the boys that pamela  could hear them loud and clear  yeah and i think about the medical  professionals too david who are now  treating their own  as a medical professional you don't  expect to end up a patient yourself in  most cases  and now many of them are in the  hospitals as well  thank you for sharing her story there  thank you for sharing her story  it was very difficult
 

